  Name: VersionHistory
  Version: 1.0.0
  Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8f09b7757ea067e4fbbba38fade85bf9, type: 3}
  Description: The VersionHistory module extracts Git commits into lightweight `VersionManifest`
    runtime assets and exports formatted `CHANGELOG.md` files based on Conventional
    Commits. It decouples editor build settings from game data to optimize build
    sizes while providing version history to in-game dev overlays.
